From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] windows.devices.bluetooth: Radios.Radio, IBluetoothAdapter2/3, GetRadioAsync (3666)

bluetooth: Windows.Devices.Radios.Radio, IBluetoothAdapter2/3, GetRadioAsync

windows.devices.bluetooth now also serves the Windows.Devices.Radios.Radio
class (Bluetooth radios only): GetRadiosAsync with an IVectorView/IIterable,
FromIdAsync, GetDeviceSelector, RequestAccessAsync, and radios with State,
Name, Kind, SetStateAsync and StateChanged. BluetoothAdapter exposes
IBluetoothAdapter2 and IBluetoothAdapter3 and GetRadioAsync returns the
adapter's radio. winebth.sys learns the BlueZ Powered property (reported to
users in BTH_LOCAL_RADIO_INFO.flags) and a SET_POWERED operation.
---
